# ==============================================================================
# ATTENTIX PRODUCTION ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. PRODUCTION GOOGLE OAUTH
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Steps to obtain your Google Cloud Client ID:
# 1. Go to Google Cloud Console: https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# 2. Click "Create Credentials" -> "OAuth Client ID" -> Application Type: "Web application"
# 3. Add to "Authorized JavaScript origins":
#    - https://attentix-app.vercel.app
#    - https://vrushabh-digraje--attentix-backend-attentix-app.modal.run
# 4. Paste the generated Client ID below:
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. AUTOMATED SMTP EMAIL ALERTS & MEETING REMINDERS (GMAIL)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Steps to obtain your 16-character Gmail App Password:
# 1. Go to: https://myaccount.google.com/security
# 2. Ensure "2-Step Verification" is turned ON.
# 3. Go to: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 4. Name it "Attentix" and click "Create".
# 5. Copy the generated 16-character password (e.g. abcd efgh ijkl mnop) below:
SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=your_email@gmail.com
SMTP_PASSWORD=your_16_character_app_password
